description "Undead Trooper

Stormtroopers mutated into shambling corpses via man-made virus. Spread the infection to prevent a slow decay.

^2Weaponry:
- Brains............................ (Melee)
-- Poisons/staggers/slows/drains on hit
-- 20% less damage
-- Grab only

^5Powers:
- Bio-Frenzy (Dark Rage 3) ^3[CS1/4]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (4)
- Starting Health: 10
- Armor Decay: 1/4s
- Fury (3)
-- 100% faster decay
- Rally
- Assemble (1)
- Getup (0)
- Full Pockets
- Conservative
- Wookalike
- 99% less knockback taken
- 99% less knockback given
- 300% slower hacking
- 20% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Lunge (Barge 1) ^3[Melee CS2]"